/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Delta is a collaborative, student-led organization at the University of Notre Dame focused on the intersection of mathematics, theory, and real-world problem-solving. Our goal is to give students a deeper understanding of how quantitative ideas drive modern decision-making in finance, technology, and research.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Each week, members engage with topics such as econometric modeling, optimization, probability, market microstructure, and quantitative finance. Through hands-on projects, discussions, and real-world case studies, students learn how abstract mathematical concepts translate into practical tools used in industry and academia.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
